{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25272","headline":"亚父碎玉斗 · 何儒亮","name":"亚父碎玉斗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嬴女昔解网，楚王有遗躅。\n破关既定秦，碎首闻献玉。\n贞姿应刃散，清响因风续。\n匪狥切泥功，将明怀璧辱。\n莫量汉祖德，空受项君勖。\n事去见前心，千秋渭水绿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"何儒亮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25272.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25272","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}